## Mobile Application (React Native / Flutter / Swift / Kotlin)

```
src/
├── screens/               # Full-page views (equivalent of pages/)
│   ├── feature-a/         # FeatureAScreen, FeatureADetailScreen
│   ├── feature-b/         # FeatureBListScreen, FeatureBDetailScreen
│   ├── settings/          # SettingsScreen, PreferencesScreen
│   └── common/            # SplashScreen, WelcomeScreen, NotFoundScreen
│
├── components/            # Reusable UI components
│   ├── ui/                # Primitives: Button, Input, Card, Modal, Badge
│   ├── layout/            # Navigation shells, tab bars, headers
│   └── shared/            # Domain components: IconDisplay, StatusBadge
│
├── navigation/            # Navigation configuration
│   ├── RootNavigator.ts   # Top-level navigator (auth vs. main)
│   ├── PublicNavigator.ts  # Public/unauthenticated flow stack
│   ├── MainNavigator.ts   # Main tabs/drawer: home, feature-a, settings
│   └── linking.ts         # Deep link configuration
│
├── services/              # External integrations
│   ├── api.ts             # HTTP client (Axios / fetch wrapper)
│   ├── socket.ts          # WebSocket / real-time client
│   ├── storage.ts         # Secure storage (Keychain / EncryptedPrefs)
│   ├── background.ts      # Background task handler
│   └── tracking.ts       # Optional telemetry / crash reporting (omit if unused)
│
├── store/                 # State management
│   ├── slices/
│   └── index.ts
│
├── hooks/                 # Custom hooks
├── lib/                   # Business logic, utilities, constants
├── types/                 # TypeScript types
├── styles/                # Theme, colors, typography, spacing constants
│   ├── theme.ts           # Color palette, spacing scale, typography scale
│   ├── colors.ts          # Theme color maps (if applicable)
│   └── typography.ts      # Font families, sizes, weights
│
└── assets/                # Images, icons, fonts, animations
    ├── icons/
    ├── images/
    ├── fonts/
    └── animations/        # Lottie files, etc.
```

