## Desktop Application (Electron / Tauri)

```
src/
├── main/                  # Main process (Node.js / Rust)
│   ├── index.ts           # App entry, window creation
│   ├── ipc/               # IPC handler definitions (main ↔ renderer)
│   ├── menu.ts            # Native menu bar configuration
│   ├── tray.ts            # System tray (if applicable)
│   ├── updater.ts         # Auto-update logic
│   └── services/          # Main-process services (file system, native APIs)
│
├── renderer/              # Frontend (same structure as Web Application above)
│   ├── app/
│   ├── components/
│   ├── lib/
│   ├── hooks/
│   ├── store/
│   ├── types/
│   └── styles/
│
├── shared/                # Types/constants shared between main and renderer
│   ├── ipcChannels.ts     # IPC channel name constants
│   └── types.ts           # Shared type definitions
│
└── preload/               # Preload scripts (secure bridge)
    └── index.ts           # Expose safe IPC methods to renderer
```

